{"title":"蔚来到底应该值多少钱？","link":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/transportation/BqLLEaO4CLvE4tnG.html","date":1795692180000,"content":"<section><section><section><section><section><img src=\"/media/cddb5193c0887662330d7469be2d4689ef1e76bc21227824c9f12c0acaf31add.png\" /></section><section><section></section></section><p><span><span>蔚来到底应该值多少钱？要回答这个问题，不妨先看蔚来内部一个看似反直觉的决定。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025年的某一天，蔚来内部正在进行一场头脑风暴，聊到了一件放在过去很难发生的事：放弃高通旗舰芯片的首发。</span></span></p><p><span><span>当时，研发已经投入，各项准备也已就绪。但团队最后算了一笔账，决定先不上了。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>万事俱备，只等首发，但我们算了一下，当时</span></span></span><span><span><span>CBU</span></span></span><span><span><span>已经深入人心了，算那笔账算不过来，所以我们真的不搞了。</span></span></span><span><span><span>”Ted</span></span></span><span><span><span>（蔚来产品体验高级副总裁李天舒）回忆道。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这件事放在以前，蔚来势必要争取到首发。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>蔚来是一家以技术创新为底色的公司，早在</span></span></span><span><span>2023</span></span><span><span><span>年就已有覆盖</span></span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span><span>个领域的全栈技术布局。对这样的公司来说，首发很有吸引力。何况研发的钱已经花了，临门一脚停下来，并不容易。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>但</span></span></span><span><span>Ted</span></span><span><span><span>说，高通骁龙</span></span></span><span><span><span>8397</span></span></span><span><span><span>旗舰芯片晚上一年，为公司省下了几十亿元。</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>座舱团队也因此腾出手，把精力放在</span></span></span><span><span>NOMI Intelligence 4.0</span></span><span><span><span>上。</span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>促成这个决定的，是蔚来正在推行的</span></span></span><span><span>CBU</span></span><span><span><span>机制。这套机制要求团队算清楚，一项业务、一笔投入，究竟能为用户和公司创造多少价值，再决定要不要做、什么时候做。按蔚来的要求，</span></span></span><span><span><span>ROI</span></span></span><span><span><span>至少要大于</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2024</span></span><span><span><span>年，蔚来开始试行</span></span></span><span><span><span>CBU</span></span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年全面推行。同年第四季度，蔚来实现经营利润转正。到</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年第二季度，蔚来已连续三个季度实现经调整经营利润为正。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>经营上的变化，让李斌开始进一步思考：这样的机制，能不能进入公司更多业务？过去很多算不清、管不过来的事，</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>能不能帮上忙？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这也是不少企业正在面对的问题。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>上个月，雷峰网拜访过一家创业公司。老板此前一直很愿意为</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>花钱，今年</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>月就给员工配备了每月</span></span></span><span><span><span>200</span></span></span><span><span><span>美元的</span></span></span><span><span><span>Codex</span></span></span><span><span><span>，公司的各项</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>开销加起来，每月约</span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>万美元。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>但几个月后，他决定砍掉近九成</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>开销。原因很现实：钱花了不少，收入和利润却没有同步增长。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>员工用上</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>，为什么公司没有更赚钱？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>麦肯锡</span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span>年的调查提供了一个观察角度：</span></span></span><span><span><span>88%</span></span></span><span><span><span>的受访者表示，其所在组织已在至少一个业务职能中使用</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>，但符合麦肯锡</span></span></span><span><span><span>“AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>高绩效企业</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>定义的受访者只占约</span></span></span><span><span><span>6%</span></span></span><span><span><span>。这些企业对工作流程进行根本性重构的可能性，接近其他企业的三倍。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>最近，几家科技公司的掌舵者也开始为</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>时代的组织变革感到焦虑。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>在百度世界</span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>大会上，李彦宏提出，</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>的下一幕是</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>智能组织</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>。他的解释是，企业只是更换了电机，却还没有重新设计工厂。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>马化腾的表达则更为急切。在腾讯近期的内部交流中，他提醒，即使一些核心业务看起来地位稳固，</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>的浪潮也已经在吞没远处的山丘，不能继续坐着欣赏。他用</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>陆战变海战，陆军变海军</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>形容这场变化，要求团队转换技能、迅速应战，组织变革也要加快。过去的业务打法、管理方式和部门边界，都需要重新审视。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>蔚来正在做的</span></span></span><span><span>AI Native</span></span><span><span><span>原生组织，与这些思考有相通之处。</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>工具要用，更重要的是，必须从企业的组织架构、业务流程、决策机制入手，进行面向</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>的全面变革，才能让</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>带来的效率提升转化为真实的经营结果。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>蔚来判断，</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>建成</span></span></span><span><span>AI Native</span></span><span><span><span>原生组织，将是下一阶段行业竞争、产业变革的关键。</span></span></span></span></strong></p><section><img src=\"/media/da603c0798605ba07572e187ac6c556050656a3d59002d6ea292c1e702e3e1a0.jpg\" /></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br /></span></section><section><strong><span>01</span><span><br /></span></strong></section></section></section><h4><strong><span><span>比开发一款车更难，蔚来为什么非做不可？</span></span><span><br /></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>不做这件事是没有出路，可能活不下去。</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>谈到为什么要做</span></span></span><span><span>AI Native</span></span><span><span><span>组织，李斌说得很现实。资源有限，行业竞争又激烈，蔚来必须回答一个问题：凭什么比别人有更大的生存概率？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>产品、服务当然要做好。除此之外，他认为，整个组织也要用新的</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>技术和理念重新改造。</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>不是</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>多部署</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent”</span></span></span><span><span><span>，而是重写经营系统。</span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这背后，首先是他对汽车产业的判断。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>过去十几年，智能电动汽车一直是全球技术创新的制高点。迈入</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>时代，</span></span></span><span><span><span>Smart EV</span></span></span><span><span><span>正在迎来全新的技术突破周期。每一台智能电动汽车，本身就具备感知、决策、执行完整闭环的</span></span></span><span><span><span>Physical AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>能力。在蔚来看来，</span></span></span><span><span><span>Smart EV</span></span></span><span><span><span>是单体价值最高、用户价值最大、产业规模最大、社会价值也最为突出的</span></span></span><span><span><span>Physical AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>赛道。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>为汽车产业带来的变革，绝不只局限于产品端的创新突破，在产业经营效率的提升上，同样蕴藏着巨大潜力。蔚来判断，汽车产业将会是体量最大的</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>应用产业。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>全球汽车产业链条庞大而复杂，覆盖研发、零部件、整车制造、销售、服务、能源、金融等众多环节，整体产业规模达到</span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span>万亿至</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span>万亿美元。面对这样一个体量庞大、链路繁复的产业链，</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>拥有极其广阔的落地空间。按照蔚来的判断，</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>在汽车产业的深度落地与应用，有机会带动全产业链效率提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>15%</span></span></span><span><span><span>，对应超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>1.2</span></span></span><span><span><span>万亿美元的新增价值。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>技术变化带动组织调整，在科技巨头的发展中已有先例。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>亚马逊曾经遇到过一个问题：业务越做越大，系统越来越复杂，团队开发和上线新功能的速度却慢了下来。为此，亚马逊把庞大的技术系统拆成可以独立运行的微服务，同时调整团队的组织方式，形成了后来广为人知的</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>两个披萨团队</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>团队规模要小到两个披萨就够吃，每个团队围绕一项具体服务，拥有开发、运营和持续改进所需的资源，也对这项服务的整个生命周期负责。技术系统拆开之后，团队也获得了相应的自主权，减少等待和交接，才能更快回应用户需求。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这个案例对蔚来的启发在于，新的技术架构要发挥作用，企业内部的分工、权限和责任，也要一起调整。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>在李斌看来，企业组织本来就应该随着技术变化而调整。蔚来成立时强调成为一家</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>用户企业</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>，也是因为移动互联网让企业能够直接连接用户、长期经营用户关系。今天到了</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>时代，公司的组织结构、流程、激励和责任机制，也需要重新考虑。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>秦力洪举了一个在门店里的具体例子。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>蔚来把销售顾问叫作</span></span></span><span><span>Fellow</span></span><span><span><span>。一名</span></span></span><span><span><span>Fellow</span></span></span><span><span><span>每天怎么安排工作，是自己决定，还是听店长的？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>如果</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>能够结合用户反馈和工作环境，帮助</span></span></span><span><span><span>Fellow</span></span></span><span><span><span>判断怎样工作更有效，他就可以自己安排，再根据结果不断调整。但新的问题随之出现：门店总经理还应该管什么？过去的管理方式和考核标准，要不要变？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这也是秦力洪觉得难的地方。讲</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>原生组织，大家都认可，落到自己的工作上，却未必愿意改变。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>你要说成口号，你问</span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人</span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人都点头，结合到他的具体工作就未必是那么回事。</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>蔚来选择从经营对象入手，把这些问题逐步拆开。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>先要回答的是，谁在经营、经营什么，以及靠什么创造价值。在蔚来的体系里，部门、团队和员工是经营主体</span></span></span><span><span>BU</span></span><span><span><span>，研发项目、车辆、电池、门店等，则是具体的经营对象</span></span></span><span><span><span>CBU</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>以研发为例，过去主要看年度预算，再由上往下分配。哪些功能值得开发，哪些项目应该停，管理者很难持续掌握所有细节。一些投入就这样沿着惯性继续了。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>现在，蔚来希望围绕具体项目，持续看清投入和产出，再据此分配资源。放弃高通旗舰芯片的首发，就是这种变化的一个例子。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>但项目、电池、门店、用户，散落在不同的业务系统里。要让</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>帮助员工经营，首先得让它读懂这些对象。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>为此，蔚来搭建了一套六层架构。</span></span></span></span></p><section><img src=\"/media/9bbb89e6824017bd444a494c2a00840f2c2b7b2de8bc7a631981ed9f93fd055b.png\" /></section><p><span><span><span><span>最底层是</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>基础设施，连接用户、车辆、换电站、门店、员工和服务器。往上是</span></span></span><span><span><span>CBU</span></span></span><span><span><span>数据层，把分散在各个系统里的数据，围绕十几大类、上千万个经营对象统一组织，让模型知道自己正在处理谁、它处于什么状态。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>再往上，通用大模型和蔚来自研的企业大模型提供基础能力，各业务领域经过验证的经营经验，则被进一步封装成体系能力模型，供</span></span></span><span><span>Agent</span></span><span><span><span>调用。最终，员工通过这些</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>完成具体工作，实际经营结果再反馈回来，帮助模型和流程继续改进。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这套架构的作用，可以从一名</span></span></span><span><span>Fellow</span></span><span><span><span>的工作看出来。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>他每天面对不同的用户，需要判断先跟进谁、怎样安排时间，也需要知道自己占用了多少资源、创造了多少价值。相关数据、公司的经营方法和工具接通之后，</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>才有条件给出符合实际业务的建议，员工也才能根据结果不断调整。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一个有意思的现象是，</span></span></span><span><span>Fellow</span></span><span><span><span>讨论工作时，开始更多地说自己</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>替公司赚了多少钱</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>。公司对</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>销冠</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>的理解，也逐渐加入了对赚钱能力的评价。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>目前，蔚来</span></span></span><span><span>9750</span></span><span><span><span>多位</span></span></span><span><span><span>Fellow</span></span></span><span><span><span>已经可以通过「麦宝」智能助手调用各类</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>，单</span></span></span><span><span><span>Fellow</span></span></span><span><span><span>经营效率同比提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>44.5%</span></span></span><span><span><span>，价值创造同比提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>8.1%</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>类似的变化，也进入了研发和供应链。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>目前，蔚来纳入管理的研发项目</span></span></span><span><span>CBU</span></span><span><span><span>超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>1800</span></span></span><span><span><span>个，相比改造之前，研发人效提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>13%</span></span></span><span><span><span>，综合研发效率提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>35%</span></span></span><span><span><span>。工业化与供应链领域，纳入管理的合作伙伴</span></span></span><span><span><span>CBU</span></span></span><span><span><span>超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>560</span></span></span><span><span><span>家，支撑超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>360</span></span></span><span><span><span>万种车型配置组合，</span></span></span><span><span><span>OTD</span></span></span><span><span><span>交付达成率达到</span></span></span><span><span><span>99%</span></span></span><span><span><span>，库存周转速度提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>23%</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>截至目前，蔚来已在企业经营管理场景上线超过</span></span></span><span><span>7500</span></span><span><span><span>个</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>，累计运行实例突破</span></span></span><span><span><span>290</span></span></span><span><span><span>万个。比数量更值得关注的是，这些</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>开始沿着同一套经营体系工作：调用与具体对象有关的数据，使用经过验证的方法，再由经营结果检验是否有效。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>换电站的经营也有类似的问题。一座赛里木湖的换电站，对上海用户可能同样有价值：用户知道长途出行有补能保障，买车时就可能更放心。蔚来希望把这种跨区域、跨业务的影响，也纳入投入回报的评估。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>再往下，还有数量更庞大的零部件。拆解得足够细，才能知道哪些可以复用、哪些投入可以减少，同时不影响用户体验。但颗粒度越细，管理难度也越大，过去依靠人工很难处理。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>因此，蔚来希望每名员工都能方便地调用</span></span></span><span><span>Agent</span></span><span><span><span>，获得公司的专业模型、经营方法和数据支持，帮助自己作出判断。相应地，员工的权限、评价标准和责任也要调整。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这些事牵涉几万人的工作习惯，还有部门之间长期形成的部门墙。李斌说，做这样的变革，</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>比开发一款车难多了</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>对于目前的整体进展，</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>李斌的反馈是已</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>初见成效</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>。若持续优化，毛利率有望提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>个百分点，长期来看，甚至有可能达到</span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>个百分点。</span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br /></span></section><section><strong><span>02</span><span><br /></span></strong></section></section></section><h4><strong><span><span>钱省下来了，竞争力怎么反而更强了？</span></span><span><br /></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>原生组织的阶段性成果，已经开始体现在蔚来的三条核心业务中：智驾用有限算力训练更强的模型，智舱围绕用户目标重构交互，能源则把经营细到每块电池、每座站。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>先看智驾。蔚来、乐道用户累计使用智能辅助驾驶约</span></span></span><span><span>96.43</span></span><span><span><span>亿公里，百万辆车每天产生海量数据。团队面临的问题是，如何用有限的算力，把这些数据变成模型的能力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>继续增加投入，当然是一种办法。但在</span></span></span><span><span>AI Native</span></span><span><span><span>的思路下，蔚来先改了数据和训练的工作流程。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>过去，模型缺什么数据、应该采集哪些场景，需要团队逐项分析。现在，蔚来把大模型引入这套流程，从发现数据缺口、生成采集策略，到挖掘数据、训练验证，再把结果写入经验池，形成持续反馈的自动化闭环。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>据介绍，相比</span></span></span><span><span>NWM 2.5</span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>NWM 3.0</span></span></span><span><span><span>的数据迭代效率提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>倍，数据规模扩大</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>倍。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>数据多了，训练的钱从哪里省？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>蔚来的办法是，减少昂贵的视频渲染。过去，要先生成道路视频，让智驾模型在里面反复练习；现在，新增的隐空间训练直接用特征表达环境变化，不必每一步都画出完整图像。这一环节的推演速度提升</span></span></span><span><span>100</span></span><span><span><span>倍，结合保留的视频验证闭环，综合训练效率提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>倍。同样的算力投入，因此能够支持更多训练。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>节省计算也发生在车端。新的时空联合编码把连续六帧图像一起处理，在展示的案例中，</span></span></span><span><span>Token</span></span><span><span><span>从</span></span></span><span><span><span>360</span></span></span><span><span><span>个减至</span></span></span><span><span><span>60</span></span></span><span><span><span>个，对应注意力计算量降至原来的</span></span></span><span><span><span>1/36</span></span></span><span><span><span>，同时更容易捕捉车轮转动等细微变化。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这些改进最终体现到驾驶表现上。配合算法、芯片和底盘的联合优化，整车控制时延平均降低</span></span></span><span><span>54%</span></span><span><span><span>；引入能够结合路况评价驾驶行为的奖励模型后，相比</span></span></span><span><span><span>NWM 2.5</span></span></span><span><span><span>，复杂场景接管率降低</span></span></span><span><span><span>40.38%</span></span></span><span><span><span>，复杂场景安心感提升</span></span></span><span><span><span>59.65%</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span>月起，「</span></span></span><span><span><span>Banyan </span></span></span><span><span><span>榕」、「</span></span></span><span><span><span>Cedar </span></span></span><span><span><span>雪松」、「</span></span></span><span><span><span>Cedar S </span></span></span><span><span><span>雪松」、「</span></span></span><span><span><span>Coconut + </span></span></span><span><span><span>椰子」四平台搭载蔚来世界模型</span></span></span><span><span><span>NWM 3.0</span></span></span><span><span><span>的全新系统版本将陆续提交备案，并在通过后向用户全量推送。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>类似的变化，也发生在座舱里。而它的起点，与开头提到的放弃首发高通旗舰芯片有着千丝万缕的关系。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>要不然没有</span></span></span><span><span><span>NOMI Intelligence 4.0</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>李斌说。</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span>但把九年的代码推倒重来，需要理由。用户积累已久的期待是一方面，更关键的是，重构的条件终于凑齐了。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>也就是天时地利人和三要素齐了：开源模型和智能体框架逐渐成熟；</span></span></span><span><span>SkyOS·</span></span><span><span><span>天枢操作系统已打通大量整车级原子能力，模型有工具可调；组织也开始打破车控、导航、媒体与</span></span></span><span><span><span>NOMI</span></span></span><span><span><span>各自为战的分工，围绕</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>重新协作。几名年轻校招生花</span></span></span><span><span><span>60</span></span></span><span><span><span>万元做出的</span></span></span><span><span><span>Demo</span></span></span><span><span><span>，则让团队看到了可行性，随后才逐步加码。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这次重构，要改变的是</span></span></span><span><span>NOMI</span></span><span><span><span>做事的方式。过去，用户说一句，系统识别意图，再交给对应功能执行。</span></span></span><span><span><span>4.0</span></span></span><span><span><span>则让模型围绕一个目标，自己规划步骤、调用工具，根据结果继续调整。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一个真实场景的案例，展示了这种区别。用户要回家取东西、买花，再去机场。</span></span></span><span><span>NOMI</span></span><span><span><span>查询航班后发现，常去的花店与家方向相反，时间紧张，于是建议换成用户收藏过的顺路花店，并将接机目的地设到靠近到达口的停车场。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>它也开始理解任务里的情感。用户让它为父亲生日选歌、记住祝福约定，再当场彩排。</span></span></span><span><span>NOMI</span></span><span><span><span>需要把歌曲检索、长期记忆和祝福表达连在一起，还要分清眼下是在演练。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>支撑这些表现的，是自研大模型矩阵、车载专属强化学习，以及整车原生智能体框架。模型负责理解和规划，框架连接整车感知、工具与安全体系，覆盖</span></span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span><span>个功能域、数千项原子能力。据了解，经过训练，典型车控任务完成率从</span></span></span><span><span><span>40%</span></span></span><span><span><span>多提升至</span></span></span><span><span><span>95.3%</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><section><img src=\"/media/215ea8d64ea05e1088affca3cc323360eda5560889d1bcee9baaf3a7acb547d8.jpg\" /></section><p><span><span><span><span>从执行一句指令，到理解一个目标并持续把事情办完，才是</span></span></span><span><span>NOMI Intelligence 4.0</span></span><span><span><span>这次重构最直接的变化。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>NOMI Intelligence 4.0</span></span><span><span><span>将分阶段覆盖各大蔚来智能系统，搭载</span></span></span><span><span><span>NOMI 4.0</span></span></span><span><span><span>的第一个版本「</span></span></span><span><span><span>Cedar </span></span></span><span><span><span>雪松 </span></span></span><span><span><span>2.0.0</span></span></span><span><span><span>」，将于</span></span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span><span>月初提交备案，通过后陆续开始推送；「</span></span></span><span><span><span>Cedar S </span></span></span><span><span><span>雪松」和「</span></span></span><span><span><span>Banyan </span></span></span><span><span><span>榕」智能系统，预计在</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span><span><span><span>年第二季度完成适配并推送；</span></span></span><span><span><span>NOMI Intelligence 4.0</span></span></span><span><span><span>，后续也将技术赋能「</span></span></span><span><span><span>Coconut &amp; Coconut + </span></span></span><span><span><span>椰子」智能系统。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>如果说智驾、智舱的变化，用户能够在车里直接感受到，那么能源业务的重构，则发生在支撑车辆运行的庞大网络中。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>145</span></span><span><span><span>万块电池、</span></span></span><span><span><span>9896</span></span></span><span><span><span>座充换电站，怎样把经营细到每一块电池、每一座站？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这些电池的资产原值超过</span></span></span><span><span>1159</span></span><span><span><span>亿元。每块电池多用一段时间，每座站少一点浪费，放到整个网络里，都是一笔可观的收益。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>蔚来的第一步，是让每块电池有一份完整履历。通过专属</span></span></span><span><span>ID</span></span><span><span><span>，打通电芯、</span></span></span><span><span><span>BMS</span></span></span><span><span><span>数据，以及装车、换电、保养、维修到退役的记录。安全监控、健康评估、延寿等能力被沉淀成模型，再由</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>调用，帮助团队作出判断，处置结果随后写回履历。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>编号尾号</span></span></span><span><span>0108</span></span><span><span><span>的电池，就是一个例子。截至今年</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月，它已服役</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span><span><span><span>个月。延寿保养</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>根据其健康状态和使用经历，安排慢充、水冷等个性化策略。据测算，这块电池的预计寿命从</span></span></span><span><span><span>12.5</span></span></span><span><span><span>年延长到</span></span></span><span><span><span>14.2</span></span></span><span><span><span>年。同一份资产可以服务更久，使用成本也就被摊薄。上线至今，延寿策略累计运行超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>7335</span></span></span><span><span><span>万次，增加了</span></span></span><span><span><span>8.1</span></span></span><span><span><span>亿元电池全生命周期使用价值。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>换电站同样要逐站算账，甚至在建设之前就开始。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>黄山祁门低碳科创园站，预测日单量只有</span></span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span><span>单，但周边近九成用户没有家充桩。智能选址</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>把补能服务、区域卖车和品牌价值一起测算，得出综合</span></span></span><span><span><span>ROI</span></span></span><span><span><span>为</span></span></span><span><span><span>1.96</span></span></span><span><span><span>。能源、区域销售和品牌团队据此共同决策，明确这座站的钱花在哪里、价值由谁获得。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>建成之后，</span></span></span><span><span>Agent</span></span><span><span><span>继续读取电价、订单预测、电池状态和用户到站时间，动态安排充电。过去依赖人工逐站调参数，现在变成分钟级预测和调整，既提前备好用户需要的电池，也尽量利用低价电。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>数据显示，过去两年，谷电利用率从</span></span></span><span><span>30%</span></span><span><span><span>提升到接近</span></span></span><span><span><span>51%</span></span></span><span><span><span>；今年</span></span></span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span><span><span><span>月出行高峰期，无需等待电池充电的订单比例也从去年的</span></span></span><span><span><span>94.3%</span></span></span><span><span><span>升至</span></span></span><span><span><span>95.5%</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这背后的工作方式，被概括为</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>数据说话、模型推演、人来拍板、</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>执行</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>。团队把经验交给模型，把重复执行交给</span></span></span><span><span><span>Agent</span></span></span><span><span><span>，再根据运行结果持续调整。单块电池、单座站验证有效的改善，才有机会在整个能源网络里复用。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>而这个网络还会继续扩大。到</span></span></span><span><span>2030</span></span><span><span><span>年，蔚来能源预计管理超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>3500</span></span></span><span><span><span>亿元电池资产、运营超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>万座换电站，年度充换电服务达到</span></span></span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>亿</span></span></span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span><span><span>次，年度充换电量预计将超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>100</span></span></span><span><span><span>亿度。</span></span></span></span></p><section><img src=\"/media/4f4f13e58809f80cc7438af00facbad3a09f99bbb7f872bf657915b8c81497eb.jpg\" /></section><p><span><span><span><span>到了这个规模，每度电优化一毛钱，对应的就是每年</span></span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span><span>亿元的经营收益空间；一座站验证有效的运营经验，可以在万座站的网络中推广。电池延寿、减少等待、提高设备利用率，每一项细小改善，都有机会随着业务规模扩大而持续放大。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>三条业务线正在验证同一件事：</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>当数据、经验、工作流程和组织分工一起改变，</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>才能持续创造产品价值与经营回报。</span></span></span></span></strong></span><span><span><span><span><span>这种能力一旦在整个公司积累起来，蔚来的竞争力就有机会随着每一次研发、每一次服务继续增长。</span></span></span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br /></span></section><section><strong><span>03</span><span><br /></span></strong></section></section></section><h4><strong><span><span>蔚来过去的投入，到了重估的时候</span></span><span><br /></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span><span>今年，汽车公司面对的压力，已经从终端价格、销量和利润，传导到了资本市场。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>估值承压，是其中最显眼的表现之一。过去几年，智能电动汽车曾经是科技投资的重要方向，如今，</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>公司、具身智能公司吸引着更多关注。汽车公司虽然也在投入</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>，外界对它们的评价，却越来越回到一个问题：这些投入，什么时候能够赚回钱？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>雷峰网此前问过李斌：资本大量涌向</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>，汽车行业反而受到冷落，车企怎样保证自己仍然站在</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>前沿？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>他的回答是，汽车本身就是一个非常大的</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>载体。但不论是哪种物理</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>，最终都要回到最根本的问题：</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>资本市场短期有风口、有起伏，但最终还是要回到企业价值，还是要看经营结果和盈利能力。</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这也是汽车行业当前处境的复杂之处。技术在进步，产品越来越好，企业却未必更容易赚钱。</span></span></span></span></p><section><img src=\"/media/598266283c425c173065978d33807ee74fc78fe2332dbeb23729211b4195f7d8.png\" /></section><p><span><span><span><span>国家统计局数据显示，</span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span>年前三季度，汽车制造业营业收入同比增长</span></span></span><span><span><span>2.6%</span></span></span><span><span><span>，营业成本增长</span></span></span><span><span><span>3.8%</span></span></span><span><span><span>，利润总额下降</span></span></span><span><span><span>22.8%</span></span></span><span><span><span>。收入增长慢于成本，利润空间被进一步挤压。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>在这样的环境里，资本市场对汽车企业的判断趋于谨慎，并不难理解。价格竞争持续，新技术不断增加投入，畅销车型又面临更快的迭代。今天卖得好，能否支撑明年的利润？一项技术领先，又能保持多久？</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>当这些问题没有稳定答案，企业积累的技术与服务能力，即使有价值，也很难被充分计入对未来收益的预期。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>而蔚来当下正在做的事，就是为了解决这种矛盾。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>过去</span></span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span><span>年，蔚来累计研发投入超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>720</span></span></span><span><span><span>亿元；截至目前，全球申请专利超过</span></span></span><span><span><span>13000</span></span></span><span><span><span>项，累计落地</span></span></span><span><span><span>220</span></span></span><span><span><span>多项全球首发和首创技术。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>从芯片、操作系统到底盘，从电驱、电池到充换电网络，蔚来铺下了一套范围很广的技术体系，而这正是蔚来化解这种矛盾的底气。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>原生组织，是蔚来顺应技术趋势化解矛盾的最优解。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>它要改变的，是过去技术投入与经营结果之间不够紧密的连接。研发积累不能只停留在一项项功能、一个个部门里，而要成为整个组织可以调用的能力，进入产品决策、资源分配和日常经营。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>因此，评价这场变革，不能只数蔚来又增加了多少模型、部署了多少</span></span></span><span><span>Agent</span></span><span><span><span>。更值得看的是，过去</span></span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span><span>年的积累，能否因此得到更充分的使用，并持续反映到经营结果中。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>科技公司历史上，类似的变化曾经发生过。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2015</span></span><span><span><span>年，亚马逊首次单独披露</span></span></span><span><span><span>AWS</span></span></span><span><span><span>的财务表现。当年第一季度，这项业务收入约</span></span></span><span><span><span>15.7</span></span></span><span><span><span>亿美元，经营利润</span></span></span><span><span><span>2.65</span></span></span><span><span><span>亿美元。原本藏在集团报表里的技术业务，有了独立可见的收入和利润，人们才更容易理解，亚马逊已经建立了怎样的云计算能力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>AWS</span></span><span><span><span>有了单独的收入和利润数据，亚马逊的技术投入才更容易被外界看懂。外界可以不熟悉一家公司的技术细节，但能够观察到收入、利润和增长质量，评价它的依据就会改变。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>英伟达则提供了另一个角度。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2006</span></span><span><span><span>年推出</span></span></span><span><span><span>CUDA</span></span></span><span><span><span>时，</span></span></span><span><span><span>GPU</span></span></span><span><span><span>通用计算的应用空间还在逐步打开。直到</span></span></span><span><span><span>2012</span></span></span><span><span><span>年，研究人员使用两块英伟达</span></span></span><span><span><span>GPU</span></span></span><span><span><span>训练</span></span></span><span><span><span>AlexNet</span></span></span><span><span><span>，在</span></span></span><span><span><span>ImageNet</span></span></span><span><span><span>竞赛中取得突破，</span></span></span><span><span><span>GPU</span></span></span><span><span><span>与深度学习之间的联系才获得了极具说服力的展示。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>CUDA</span></span><span><span><span>并非等到</span></span></span><span><span><span>AI</span></span></span><span><span><span>热起来才开始建设。新的技术浪潮到来时，多年的投入已经形成了可以被开发者使用的工具与平台，积累因此有了更大的用武之地。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>把这两个案例放在一起看，长期投入能否获得重新评价，需要两个条件：新的应用机会出现，企业也有能力把积累转化为可持续的经营成果。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>今天，大模型与智能体给汽车行业带来了前一个条件。蔚来正在通过</span></span></span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>原生组织，补上后一个条件。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这也解释了为什么，此时讨论蔚来的价值，应该比过去多看一步。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>过去看研发投入，要问它能否带来下一款有竞争力的车；接下来，还要看这些研发能力能否被更多业务复用，提高整个公司的投入产出效率。过去看服务和换电网络，要问公司还要为此花多少钱；接下来，也要看随着用户和车辆保有量扩大，这些网络能否创造更多收入，形成更好的经营回报。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>AI</span></span><span><span><span>原生组织要做的，就是让这种长期经营变得更精细、更有效率。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>所以，蔚来应该被重新定价的依据，是它比其他公司更有机会改变过去</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>投入很多、回报难以看清</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>的状态。</span></span></span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span><span><span><span>年的技术、产品和用户积累，正在通过新的组织方式，向经营能力转化。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>这场转化最终要用持续的利润和现金流来证明。但对蔚来的观察，也应该从花了多少钱，进一步走向这些积累正在创造什么、未来还能创造多少。</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>汽车行业要走出估值压力，需要这样的经营答案；蔚来的探索，给企业提供了一条值得继续追踪的路径。</span></span></span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p></p>","author":"","comments":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/transportation/BqLLEaO4CLvE4tnG.html#comments","siteTitle":"雷锋网","siteHash":"3a4d25fa993efff53684a1fbcfe8c8754622bdab9288f0cfa67012a4971dcc52","entryHash":"89a7b4e9c542c8e29a0531a816331cad10e621fb6dfd55d24eb50781621561fb","category":"AI"}